      "Select the unique nonblack color with four cells occupying at most three rows and columns.",
      "Collect every row and column containing exactly two target cells.",
      "Detect the rectangle special case when there are two paired rows and two paired columns.",
      "For a rectangle, keep only the paired rows when the column span is longer, otherwise only the paired columns.",
      "For a non-rectangle, keep all paired rows and paired columns.",
