    "source": "canonical.written_solution",
    "target_status": "source_written",
    "target_text": "Find the unique nonblack color occurring exactly four times on at most three rows and three columns. Extend every row and column containing exactly two of those four cells into a full line of that color, clearing all distractors. If the four cells are the corners of a rectangle, extend only the rectangle's longer axis: its two rows when it is wider, otherwise its two columns."
